**Severity floor (binding).**
- **Blocker:** a leave-time save delivered to a quote other than the one on screen (leave, switch, persona switch); a leave-time save sent under another persona's identity; a leave-time save for a caller the server would refuse, after a 409, or for a purchase price change with an empty or invented reason; a CSV cell starting `=` `+` `-` `@` TAB CR written bare; **an existing test weakened, relaxed, skipped or deleted other than the one ANSWER-1 renamed**; any product `.cs`, price, rate or number changed (0 expected). Any security-shaped Blocker: NO GO and the re-gate belongs to a tier-1 (Opus) seat.
- **Major:** **a lost edit in any covered case** (an editable owned valid idle Draft left by a nav link, Back, a hash change, the Proposal/Review link, a quote switch or a persona switch inside the window); a second save after a leave (timer not cancelled); a save on a clean screen; a console error or unhandled rejection after unmount; `beforeunload` armed when clean or left armed after leaving; New quote enabled while dirty; page overflow above 0 at 1440, 1280 or 390 for any of the three personas; the Action unreachable by keyboard or by scroll-and-click; `b46-home` not 15/15 at both widths; `b352-followups` not green at both widths or not red at base where the builder says; the dotnet test not red under the swap on either host; a mutant of a covered behaviour surviving without an equivalence argument where a reachable defect exists.
- **Minor:** **a new word** (any readable string not at base; "does not deploy"); a lost edit in a residue case the STATUS did not name (named = Note); a surviving mutant with no equivalence argument and no reachable defect; an unnamed unbuilt ticket clause ("the same for New quote" met by gating, not saving, with no comment saying so); an untested guard; a wrong-day CSV name at any oracle instant; CodeQL pending (conditional verdict, never GO); a landing-text omission (MPSCALC-311 absent from the title and body).
- **Note:** wording; the hint sentence not naming New quote; the Action not visible until the wrapper scrolls (owner question); a rental row not covered by the dotnet test; the second stub-bundle `Not implemented`; style.

